content:
Lately, I dream over logics and codes
For those inscrutable colorful fonts in IDE;
Has finally begun making sense now!

Oh how I wish to hit - again - those roads
Tripping on YouTube, photos and memory;
Sunset and sky watching is the new wow!

Return back to the time we had,
It it were just possible dear
Cause still in moments I need the most
I wish you were just here
To hold me up and hug me tight
I wish you were just near... #aji #love #missYou #dreams #SerendipitousSoul
